        "prompt": "The human looked at the pull request and sent it back to you:\n\n{{Node.Input}}\n\nChange the prototype as they ask (read any comments they left on the pull request with get_pr_review), check the preview still runs, commit, and reply as usual."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e971d7ac-60c9-4507-95cf-bdabf36491bb",
      "type": "AI",
      "label": "Plan",
      "config": {
